    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Cumulative frequency is the running total of frequencies up to a certain point in grouped data. To find cumulative frequency for any group, add the frequency of that group to the total frequencies of all groups before it.</p>",
